m Media NFC &amp; QR Digital Indonesia</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-display leading-[1.1]\">Satu Kartu Pintar untuk Semua Kontak &amp; Identitas Kamu.</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-normal\">Beralih dari kartu nama kertas yang boros. Sekali tap NFC atau scan QR, kontak &amp; portofoliomu langsung tersimpan di smartphone prospek.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2\"><a id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-sm font-bold shadow-sm transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" href=\"/login\">Mulai Pakai Ony Gratis <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://shopee.co.id/onynfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 border border-slate-300 text-sm font-semibold transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h18\"></path><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path></svg> Order Kartu Fisik Shopee</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200/80 max-w-lg text-xs\"><div><div class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-display\">1-Tap Save</div><div class=\"text-slate-500\">vCard Auto-Save</div></div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-display\">NFC + QR</div><div class=\"text-slate-500\">Dual Access</div></div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-display\">1x Bayar</div><div class=\"text-slate-500\">Tanpa Biaya Langganan</div></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-sm mx-auto flex items-center justify-center p-4\"><div class=\"w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-5 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl text-white space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></div><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold tracking-wider\">ONY SMART MEDIA</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wifi text-cyan-400\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-between\"><div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\">Pemilik Kartu</div><div class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white font-display mt-0.5\">Alexandra Chen</div><div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5\">ID: ONY-8829-PRO</div></div><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-emerald-500/40\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white font-display\">1-Tap Connected</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 truncate\">vCard tersimpan otomatis ke Kontak HP</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"use-cases\" class=\"py-16 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200/70\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display mb-2\">Pilih Solusi Sesuai Kebutuhan Bisnis</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm\">Satu ekosistem media pintar Ony mendukung berbagai skenario penggunaan.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 flex-wrap mb-8\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg>Business Card</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg>Google Review</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg>Custom Profile Link</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tv\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"15\" x=\"2\" y=\"7\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><polyline points=\"17 2 12 7 7 2\"></polyline></svg>QR Standee Akrilik</button></div><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start justify-between\"><div class=\"space-y-3 flex-1\"><div class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-[11px] font-bold\">Populer</div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">NFC Business Card Physical</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Cukup 1 tap kartu fisik ke HP prospek. Kontak WhatsApp, profil, dan media sosial tersimpan tanpa aplikasi tambahan.</p><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user-check text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"16 11 18 13 22 9\"></polyline></svg><span>Cocok untuk: <strong class=\"text-slate-800\">Eksekutif, Sales, Real Estate, Business Owner</strong></span></div></div><a href=\"https://shopee.co.id/onynfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full md:w-auto px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0 transition-all\">Lihat di Shopee <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"py-20 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-14\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Cara Kerja</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">3 Langkah Mudah Menghubungkan Kartu</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 font-mono\">LANGKAH <!-- -->01</span><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wifi\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Tap atau Scan</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Tempelkan kartu NFC ke bagian belakang smartphone atau scan Kode QR.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 font-mono\">LANGKAH <!-- -->02</span><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Klaim Akun Google</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Login 1-klik dengan akun Google untuk menghubungkan kartu secara aman.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 font-mono\">LANGKAH <!-- -->03</span><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Atur Profil &amp; Siap Pakai</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Masukkan nomor kontak, link sosial media, atau direct link sesuai keinginan.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"py-20 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200/70\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-14\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Fitur Utama</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">Semua Fitur Kelola Kartu dalam Satu Tempat</h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wifi\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Dual Access (NFC + QR)</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Mendukung semua tipe smartphone lewat tap sensor NFC maupun scan QR Code.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column\"><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Analitik Interaksi Real-time</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Pantau jumlah tap dan klik link profil kamu langsung dari dashboard.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Multi-Media Management</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Kelola banyak kartu bisnis, stiker, dan standee dalam satu akun Google.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-qr-code\"><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"16\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M21 16h-3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M21 21v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 3h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 16v.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 21v-1\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Export QR Studio HD</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Download file QR Code kualitas cetak tinggi (PNG &amp; Vector) siap pakai.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Mode Proteksi Kartu Hilang</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Kunci atau matikan kartu fisik secara instan jika hilang agar data tetap aman.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-2xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h18\"></path><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Official Store Integration</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Pesan kartu tambahan atau gantungan akrilik baru dengan mudah.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-14\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Perbandingan Efisiensi</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">Mengapa Memilih Ony Smart Media?</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-stretch\"><div class=\"p-7 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Kartu Kertas Konvensional</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display\">Boros &amp; Mudah Hilang</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rose-500 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Cetak berulang setiap kali nomor atau jabatan berubah</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rose-500 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>80%+ kartu terbuang tanpa disimpan penerima</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rose-500 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Lawan bicara harus mengetik nomor HP manual</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rose-500 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Tidak ada statistik data berapa kali kartu dibaca</li></ul></div><div class=\"p-7 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 text-white space-y-4 shadow-lg border border-slate-800\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Ony Smart Media</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white font-display\">1 Kartu Berlaku Seumur Hidup</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-emerald-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Bebas edit kontak &amp; link profil kapan saja gratis</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-emerald-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Kontak tersimpan otomatis 1-tap via vCard</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-emerald-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Analitik tap &amp; scan terpantau di dashboard</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-emerald-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Desain fisik modern &amp; profesional saat networking</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white text-center px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight font-display\">Siap Memodernisasi Kartu Bisnismu?</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto\">Gunakan Ony gratis sekarang dengan akun Google. Siapkan kartu pintar pertamamu dalam hitungan detik.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center pt-2\"><a id=\"bottom-cta\" class=\"px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-100 text-sm font-bold transition-all shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" href=\"/login\">Mulai Gratis <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://shopee.co.id/onynfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white border border-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Order Kartu di Shopee <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-10 bg-white text-slate-600 text-xs\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img alt=\"Ony\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-7 w-auto object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-slate-400\">|</span><span>© 2026 Ony Ecosystem. All rights reserved.</span></div><div cla